{"date": "2021-03-13", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0313.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:46:39+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "21c43d69d4be0370a91507f0a44b5778d3862ba4ac697388b350c364ebcd2fd1", "image_bytes": 174256, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Sat, 06 Mar 2021 00:19:50 GMT", "title": "宜坦然面对", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "祖与占", "author": "弗朗索瓦·特吕弗", "author_roles": ["导演"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "review_flags": ["low_ocr_confidence"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "你试图拒绝世俗的虚伪，追随自己的理想，你想创造爱情，但先驱者得要谦逊而非自我中心，如今我们必须坦然面对现实。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2021-03-14", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0314.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:46:39+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "e52a530cd7ac95c3c17b61f772e1c68226671d6e5ad37fb1f29730b9fa672f21", "image_bytes": 163010, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Sun, 07 Mar 2021 15:07:59 GMT", "title": "宜自我定义", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "刘擎西方现代思想讲义", "author": "刘擎", "author_roles": ["学者"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "所有的价值都是人主观创造出来的，生命活动的标志就是能够自己确立价值，这是生命本身的力量。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2021-03-15", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0315.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:46:39+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "90982a2df8a25c6b789760582c6d9a4c66792d4b80d77c55efa59b7e8867a833", "image_bytes": 149037, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Sun, 14 Mar 2021 12:57:48 GMT", "title": "宜健忘", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "弗里达", "author": "朱丽·泰莫", "author_roles": ["导演"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "你认为对于婚姻来说，什么是最重要的呢？健忘。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2021-03-16", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0316.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:46:40+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "ba6980ec7673a2d758942bee84e6300880e722bf0cd2098c39e27b26df5e1605", "image_bytes": 165980, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 15 Mar 2021 00:04:26 GMT", "title": "忌势利", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "糜骨之墩", "author": "奥尔加·托卡尔丘克", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "在大自然的领域，没有“有用的生物”和“无用的生物”之说。这只是人类对物种进行的一种极不明智的分类。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2021-03-17", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0317.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:46:40+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "1759d35a0d675b03794e53ddd7f142629debf11de0f93f978138b027d89265d5", "image_bytes": 163786, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 15 Mar 2021 00:04:26 GMT", "title": "忌“大团圆”", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "坟", "author": "鲁迅", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "于是无问题，无缺陷，无不平，也就无解决，无改革，无反抗。因为凡事总要“团圆”，正无须我们焦躁；放心喝茶，睡觉大吉。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2021-03-18", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0318.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:46:40+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "10130c6604dae984d0bffb7b632e4a1d130e73cddd01896b81da191e7402f7d1", "image_bytes": 152894, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 15 Mar 2021 00:04:27 GMT", "title": "宜流动", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "云游", "author": "奥尔加·托卡尔丘克", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "行动起来。走动起来。离开的人是有福的。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1}
{"date": "2021-03-19", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0319.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:46:40+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "6ccc222f4364ec42b9613f2d98c427dd94e02099d23b2c9c176b020cad308fec", "image_bytes": 164718, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 15 Mar 2021 00:04:28 GMT", "title": "宜直面自我", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "尼尔．盖曼随笔集", "author": "尼尔·盖曼", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "诚实才重要。脆弱才重要。坦诚对待过去的自己、处于困难境地的自己，比任何事情都重要。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
